WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 005. DO NOT AUTOMATE THE SERVICE. Separate its steps first.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
THREE FUTURES. SOFTWARE. HUMAN. GONE. Each step earns a disposition.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
REMOVE. DELETE LOW-VALUE REPETITION. Do not automate waste.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
KEEP HUMAN. PROTECT JUDGMENT. Retain ambiguous, consequential, exception-heavy work.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
AUTOMATE. PROTOTYPE STABLE RULES. A candidate is not deployment approval.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
WORKFLOW. USE ALL THREE PATHS. Map the work before automation.
